%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: sections fixture
% The source of sections.pdf. Regenerate it with:
%   gs -q -dNOPAUSE -dBATCH -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.7 -sOutputFile=sections.pdf sections.ps
% Its PDF 2.0 copy, sections-pdf20.pdf, is the same command with
% -dCompatibilityLevel=2.0. Its RC4 copies, with an empty user password, add
% to that command (Ghostscript 10.00.0):
%   -sOwnerPassword=owner -dEncryptionR=2 -dKeyLength=40 -dPermissions=-64 -sOutputFile=encrypted-rc4-40.pdf
%   -sOwnerPassword=owner -dEncryptionR=3 -dKeyLength=80 -dPermissions=-3904 -sOutputFile=encrypted-rc4-80.pdf
%   -sOwnerPassword=owner -dEncryptionR=3 -dKeyLength=88 -dPermissions=-3904 -sOutputFile=encrypted-rc4-88.pdf
% and its AES-128 copy whose crypt filter gives the key length in bits is
% pdfcpu 0.16.0's:
%   pdfcpu encrypt --mode aes --key 128 --opw owner sections.pdf encrypted-aes128-cf-bits.pdf
% Eight pages, and an outline two levels deep whose entries share a page twice
% (Chapter 2 and Sampling on page five, Analysis and the second Summary on page
% six) and repeat a title (Summary), which is what the section tests read.
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
/line { 72 exch moveto show } def
(Page one. Preface. Why this booklet exists.) 720 line
(The preface ends on this page.) 700 line
showpage
(Page two. Chapter 1 Foundations.) 720 line
(Foundations open the first chapter.) 700 line
showpage
(Page three. Terms.) 720 line
(Every term is defined here.) 700 line
showpage
(Page four. Summary of the foundations.) 720 line
(The first summary closes chapter one.) 700 line
showpage
(Page five. Chapter 2 Methods.) 720 line
(Sampling starts on the same page as its chapter.) 700 line
showpage
(Page six. Analysis.) 720 line
(The second summary shares this page with analysis.) 700 line
showpage
(Page seven. Chapter 3 Results.) 720 line
(Results are reported here.) 700 line
showpage
(Page eight. Appendix.) 720 line
(The appendix is the last entry.) 700 line
showpage
[ /Title (Preface) /Page 1 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Count -2 /Title (Chapter 1 Foundations) /Page 2 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Terms) /Page 3 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Summary) /Page 4 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Count -3 /Title (Chapter 2 Methods) /Page 5 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Sampling) /Page 5 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Analysis) /Page 6 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Summary) /Page 6 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Chapter 3 Results) /Page 7 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Appendix) /Page 8 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Sections fixture) /Author (libgen-mcp tests) /DOCINFO pdfmark
